+ ```tabular

- column  Given
+ column  Given

- column  True
- column  False
+ column  Истина
+ column  Ложь

- row  `yesNoTruth`  `yes`  `no`
+ row  `yesNoTruth`  `yes`  `no`

- row  `onOffTruth`  `on`  `off`
+ row  `onOffTruth`  `on`  `off`

- row  `oneZeroTruth`  `1`  `0`
+ row  `oneZeroTruth`  `1`  `0`

= row  `oneZeroTruth`  `1`  `0`
- ```
+ ```

